# BondX BX-0bd4db48e5 - NBO XB gate
# TBS301:A@BR11 ... LEU83:A@O ; TBS301:A@BR12 ... GLU81:A@O ; TBS301:A@BR13 ... PHE80:A@pi(ring) ; TBS301:A@BR10 ... ILE10:A@O
# CAUTION: ORCA has no built-in NBO. The NBO keyword calls NBO 7, a licensed program.
